# Local model downloads (fetched at runtime, never committed). Anchored to the
# repo root so it can't shadow the `Sources/SkylarkCore/Models/` source dir
# (ARCHITECTURE §1). Runtime models actually live in ~/Library/Application
# Support/Skylark/Models, outside the repo entirely.
/Models/
screenshots/
